          "top": 0.40625,
          "right": 1364.5,
          "bottom": 276.203125,
          "left": 328.5
        },
        "targetText": "5. Produce the components of the actual reflected inputStart with an arbitrary globally centered f. Obtain fP from the same actual conditional expectation and fV=V0*Rf. Define g by the actual U action. Integral preservation gives mean(g)=mean(f)-[mean(f)-mean(f)]=0, so the SAME existing producer applies to g and supplies its actual gP. No zero-output-mean premise or RHS-defined component is used.f⊥=Rf, fV=V0∗f⊥, g=U(ιfP−i⊥f⊥),∫gdJ=0,ιgP=Pg.Corresponding Lean step  have hGlobal70 :\n      (∀ f : Lp ℝ 2 J, (∫ z, f z ∂J)=0 →\n                            ∃ fP : HP0,\n                              HP0.subtypeL fP=condExpL2 ℝ ℝ (μ:=J) measurable_snd.comap_le f ∧\n                              let fperp : Hperp := R f\n                              let fV : HP0 := V0.adjoint fperp\n                    ",
        "bodyVisibility": "visible",
        "bodyDisplay": "block",
