        "targetText": "7. Derive the actual polar rotation on the full micro spaceLinearity of U,R and V0* gives the reflected macro contribution Gamma0 fP minus the reflected micro contribution V0*D fperp. Apply the full-domain intertwining identity to this actual fperp in ker P. This yields the formula for gV=V0*Rg on its actual output semantics.gV=V0∗RUιfP−V0∗Df⊥=Γ0fP+A0V0∗f⊥=Γ0fP+A0fV.Corresponding Lean step    have hgVformula : V0.adjoint (R g)=ΓP0 fP+A0 fV := by\n      change V0.adjoint (R (U (P f-(f-P f))))=_\n      rw [hInput,map_sub,map_sub,hRUm,map_sub,hVadjB]\n      have hd := DFunLike.congr_fun hIntertwine fperp\n      change V0.adjoint (D fperp)= -(A0 fV) at hd\n      change ΓP0 fP-V0.adjoint (D fperp)=_\n      rw [hd,sub_neg_eq_add]\nExact compiled BODY span; preceding local definitions and inherited Hilb",
